+
+```text
+1. Reproducer C (≤80 lines) in tests/benchmark/programs/ or hotspots/godbolt-kernels/
+2. scripts/godbolt.py compare FILE --local target/fastbuild/lccc \
+     --oracles gcc16.2,clang,icc,icx --function NAME \
