+## Bugs / inefficiencies / structural (expanded)
+
+### Codegen / RA
+
+- Fat intervals vs `segments` (xmltok/inflate).
+- `enable_splitting` dead.
+- Dual RA (IR + MachInst).
+- Dual coalescers.
+- Location = HashSet pile (`never_materialized`, `fused_cmp_*`, `cmp_replay`, `load_cast_fold`, nohome classes).
